; SINGLE-source pattern -> ALWAYS the coref DFS (no trie-join fast path can claim it).
; One NewVar must fire ALL THREE child loops: vars (matches the stored $), sizes
; (1-byte a / 2-byte bb / 3-byte ccc, each its own SIZES class), arities ((n 1)).
; Dropping any loop silently loses exactly that class of atom.
(d a)
(d bb)
(d ccc)
(d (n 1))
(d $)
(exec 0 (, (d $x)) (, (out $x)))
